      "id": "impact",
      "narrative": "cover",
      "html": "\n  <section class=\"dao-slide dao-slide--impact td td--cover\">\n    <div class=\"td-class\"><span>CASE 01 / SECURITY INCIDENT</span><span class=\"td-status\">STATUS: <b>IRREVERSIBLE</b></span></div>\n    <div class=\"td-evidence\"><span class=\"td-dot\"></span> BLOCKCHAIN INCIDENT RECORD · 17.06.2016</div>\n    <p class=\"td-label\">THE DAO / WITHDRAWAL EXPLOIT</p>\n    <div class=\"td-amount\"><small>VALUE EXTRACTED</small><strong>3,641,694</strong><span>ETH</span></div>\n    <h1>A ordem errada<br>custou uma <em>chain.</em></h1>\n    <div class=\"td-cover-meta\"><span class=\"td-tag td-tag--lime\">REENTRANCY</span><span class=\"td-tag td-tag--red\">CRITICAL</span><span>US$ 60M AT THE TIME</span></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>01 / 05</span></div>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "protocol",
      "narrative": "protocol",
      "html": "\n  <section class=\"dao-slide dao-slide--protocol td td--protocol\">\n    <div class=\"td-class\"><span>EXHIBIT A / PROTOCOL PROMISE</span><span>2016</span></div>\n    <p class=\"td-label\">THE DEAL, AS WRITTEN</p>\n    <h2>Um fundo de<br><em>US$ 150M.</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"td-lead\">A DAO permitia votar em projetos — e também sair da decisão levando sua fração do ETH.</p>\n    <div class=\"td-flow\">\n      <div class=\"td-step\"><b>01</b><span>INVESTIDOR</span><small>discorda de uma proposta</small></div>\n      <i class=\"td-arrow\">↓</i>\n      <div class=\"td-step\"><b>02</b><span>splitDAO()</span><small>solicita a retirada</small></div>\n      <i class=\"td-arrow\">↓</i>\n      <div class=\"td-step\"><b>03</b><span>ETH DE VOLTA</span><small>promessa do protocolo</small></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"td-footnote\">A falha não estava na promessa. Estava na sequência que a cumpria.</p>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>02 / 05</span></div>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "vulnerability",
      "narrative": "vulnerability",
      "html": "\n  <section class=\"dao-slide dao-slide--vulnerability td td--trace\">\n    <div class=\"td-class\"><span>EXHIBIT B / EXECUTION TRACE</span><span>splitDAO.sol</span></div>\n    <p class=\"td-label\">THE VULNERABILITY</p>\n    <h2>Read. Call.<br><em>Write?</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"td-code-win\">\n      <div class=\"td-code-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>splitDAO.sol</b></div>\n      <div class=\"td-code-body\">\n        <div class=\"td-ln\"><i>01</i><code>balance = balances[msg.sender]</code><span>READ</span></div>\n        <div class=\"td-ln td-ln--danger\"><i>02</i><code>msg.sender.call.value(balance)()</code><span>EXTERNAL CALL</span></div>\n        <div class=\"td-ln td-ln--muted\"><i>03</i><code>balances[msg.sender] = 0</code><span>STATE WRITE</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"td-note\"><b>02</b><p>O controle sai do DAO <strong>antes</strong> de o saldo ser zerado.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"td-remedy\"><span>REMEDY</span><p>Checks → Effects → Interactions</p></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>03 / 05</span></div>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "reentrancy",
      "narrative": "reentrancy",
      "html": "\n  <section class=\"dao-slide dao-slide--reentrancy td td--reentry\">\n    <div class=\"td-class\"><span>EXHIBIT C / ATTACK PATH</span><span>LOOP DETECTED</span></div>\n    <p class=\"td-label\">REENTRANCY, VISUALIZED</p>\n    <h2>O mesmo saldo.<br><em>De novo.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"td-orbit\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 510\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ciclo de reentrância\"><path class=\"td-orbit-path\" d=\"M142 189 C130 40 378 20 507 113 C640 209 558 424 387 439 C190 456 73 328 142 189\"/><path class=\"td-orbit-arrow\" d=\"M139 189 l27 -30 l11 37\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"189\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"507\" cy=\"113\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"387\" cy=\"439\" r=\"8\"/></svg><div class=\"td-orbit-node td-orbit-node--one\"><b>01</b><span>chama<br><code>splitDAO()</code></span></div><div class=\"td-orbit-node td-orbit-node--two\"><b>02</b><span>ETH enviado<br>para fora</span></div><div class=\"td-orbit-node td-orbit-node--three\"><b>03</b><span><code>fallback()</code><br>chama de novo</span></div><div class=\"td-orbit-core\"><strong>SALDO</strong><span>NÃO MUDOU</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"td-verdict\"><span>RESULTADO</span><strong>REENTRA → SACA → REENTRA → SACA</strong></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>04 / 05</span></div>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "hard-fork",
      "narrative": "hard-fork",
      "html": "\n  <section class=\"dao-slide dao-slide--hard-fork td td--fork\">\n    <div class=\"td-class\"><span>EXHIBIT D / NETWORK DECISION</span><span>HARD FORK</span></div>\n    <p class=\"td-label\">THE AFTERMATH</p>\n    <h2>Uma rede.<br><em>Duas histórias.</em></h2>\n    <p class=\"td-lead\">O Ethereum decidiu reverter o roubo. A comunidade se dividiu sobre a própria ideia de imutabilidade.</p>\n    <div class=\"td-forkline\"><div class=\"td-forkline-origin\"><span>17.06.2016</span><b>DAO HACK</b></div><div class=\"td-forkline-branch\"><div class=\"td-forkline-eth\"><span>ETH</span><b>Ethereum</b><small>fundos restaurados</small></div><div class=\"td-forkline-etc\"><span>ETC</span><b>Ethereum Classic</b><small>chain original</small></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"td-lesson\"><span>THE LASTING RULE</span><p>Segurança não é uma camada. É a ordem do código.</p></div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>05 / 05</span></div>\n"
    }
